# C4: filtered pages - per-step filter-rule evaluation, secondary pool dynamics
Geometry Mesh
    Name DepthDose
    X -10.0  10.0    1
    Y -10.0  10.0    1
    Z   0.0  18.0  360

Filter
    Name Primaries     # generation 0 only
    GEN = 0

Filter
    Name Protons       # primary and secondary protons
    Z = 1

Output
    Filename dose_filtered.bdo
    Geo DepthDose
    Quantity Dose
    Quantity Dose Primaries
    Quantity Dose Protons
